  "reading": "The sketch lays out a full month-view calendar app page: a 64px top bar with nav arrows, a 'Today' pill, the month title, a Day/Week/Month view toggle and a teal '+ Event' button; a left sidebar containing a small November mini-month picker (with the 12th highlighted) and a 4-item colour-coded legend (Work/Launches/Travel/Holidays); a large 7-column by 5-week month grid with day numbers, several event entries (a teal 'Birthday: Sam', 'Design crit', 'Planning', 'Retro', 'Fly home', a teal circular '12' chip, a dashed 'Code freeze' bar), a cream/orange-striped 'Lisbon offsite' travel bar and a solid purple 'Launch week: Atlas 2.0' bar; and a floating event-detail popup card (title, coloured dot, date/location/owner text, four empty attendee avatar circles, and Join/Edit/Delete buttons) overlaying the grid. All text, colours and exact pixel geometry are taken verbatim from the user's typed notes.",
